        "summary": "Tetranuclear Dy cluster is a field-dependent SMM: χMT = 57.03 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K and 31.93 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K; Mmax = 19.04 Nβ at 7 T and 1.8 K. Zero-field ac χ″ is frequency-dependent without peaks; under 3.0 kOe a dual-relaxation process appears (SR Ueff = 2.2 K, τ0 = 8.4×10−6 s). Photochromism: pale yellow to orange; new UV–vis band ~487 nm saturating after 50 min Xe irradiation; PL at 445 nm (λex 360 nm) is fully quenched, attributed to photogenerated radicals rather than [4+4] cycloaddition.",
